  "details": "Since the recent update, opening main menu tabs that have many thumbnails (worlds, people search, etc) cause the entire game to lag hard. This includes even voices and video playback. Sometimes it even knocks the video player out of sync, making it take several seconds to recover.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Open the main menu\n\n2. Switch to the worlds tab\n\n3. Enjoy the lag spike\n\n4. Switch to another category, or search for a term\n\n5. Enjoy additional lag spike",
